                  "text": "In 2026, September 30 falls during U.S. Daylight Saving Time, so Eastern Time is UTC\u20114.  \nSpain (Madrid) observes Central European Summer Time during that period, which is UTC+2.  \nThe 6\u2011hour time\u2011zone difference (Madrid ahead) means that 5:00\u202fPM ET corresponds to 11:00\u202fPM local time on the same calendar day.\n\nANSWER: 2026-09-30 23:00"
